    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_01=Contributing Green Energy towards the future
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_02=Surround with rings of Solar Reflectors
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_03=The Reflectors increase the internal heat value of the Tower (see below for formula)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_04=Each Reflector ring increases tier, the first ring is required for the Tower to work
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_05=Input: Solar Salt (Cold)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_06=Output: Solar Salt (Hot)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_07=Every cycle (10 seconds), heat increases and all the Cold Solar Salt is heated
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_08=Converting Cold to Hot Solar Salt reduces heat, equal to the amount converted
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_09=This conversion only happens if heat >= 30000 and controller efficiency = 100%
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_10=If there's more Cold Salt than heat, all the heat is used up and returns to 0
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_11=The heat increase is most efficient at exactly half of maximum heat
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_12=Minimum efficiency at 0 or 100000 heat, maximum efficiency at 50000
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_13=Heat Efficiency formula: ( 7000 - [|currentHeat - 50000| ^ 0.8]) / 7000
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_14=Heat gain per cycle: numberHeaters * heatEfficiency * (10 + bonus)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_15=Bonus: 1 ring  = +1, 2 rings = +2, 3 rings = +4, 4 rings = +8, 5 rings = +16
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_16=Total number of reflectors based on how many rings are built:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_00863_Index_17=1 ring = 36, 2 rings = 88, 3 rings = 156, 4 rings = 240, 5 rings = 340
