    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_19=Toggle debug mode to reduce cycle time to 30s but disable water I/O
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_20=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_21=§b§oContaminants and ionized particles in water can cause significant imperfections in delicate
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_22=§b§oprocesses related to the cutting and engraving of silicon wafers and chips. It is crucial that
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_23=§b§othe water is systematically purified through a series of increasingly precise and complex
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09402_Index_24=§b§opurification processes, and this multiblock is the heart of the operation
