    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_03=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_04=Complete heating cycles by first heating the water to §c10000K§7,
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_05=and then cooling it back down to §c0K
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_06=Initial temperature is reset to §c0K§7 on recipe start
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_07=Each completed heating cycle boosts success chance by §c33%
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_08=If the temperature ever reaches §c12500K§7 the recipe will fail and output steam
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_09=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_10=Consumes up to §c10L/s §fHelium Plasma§7 and up to §c100L/s §fSuper Coolant
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_11=§cRaises §7the temperature by §c100K§7 per liter of plasma consumed
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_12=§cLowers §7the temperature by §c5K§7 per liter of coolant consumed
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_13=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_14=§b§oStep five of water purification is to evaporate complex organic polymers and extremophile organisms
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_15=§b§othat might be resistant to simple acids, clarifying agents, and filters. Using an ultra high
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_16=§b§opressure chamber in combination with extreme temperature fluctuations allows the water to remain
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_17=§b§osupercritical while evaporating any remaining contaminants, ready for filtration
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09408_Index_18=§7§m-----------------------------------------
