    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_04=During operation, swap the lens in the §fLens Housing
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_05=The multiblock will output a signal through the §fLens Indicator Hatch
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_06=when the current lens must be swapped
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_07=Lens swaps will be requested in random intervals of §c3 to 15s
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_08=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_09=Success chance is boosted by §c10.0% §7for each successful swap performed.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_10=Removing a lens too early will fail the recipe
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_11=Find the order of lenses in the recipe in NEI,
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_12=or use a portable scanner to view the currently requested lens
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_13=The recipe always starts at the Orundum Lens
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_14=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_15=§b§oThe sixth step of water purification involves identifying any remaining negatively charged ions within
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_16=§b§othe water which may cause electrical faults in future wafer manufacturing. Bombarding the water with varying
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_17=§b§owavelengths of photon beams will impart energy into outer-shell electrons, causing them to detach from the
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_18=§b§oatoms themselves and pass through the walls of the tank, ensuring the water is perfectly electrically polar.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09409_Index_19=§7§m-----------------------------------------
