    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_06=To decode the signal, interpret the signal strength as a 4-bit number from 0-15
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_07=Denote the lowest bit as bit 1, and the highest as bit 4
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_08=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_09=§f§lBit 1: §9§lOzone Sparging by Inert Gas
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_10=If this bit is on, you must insert an §finert gas§7 into the machine
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_11=To determine which gas to insert, interpret bits §f2-3§7 as a 2-bit number
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_12=§70: §c10000L §fHelium§7 / 1: §c7500L §fNeon§7 / 2: §c5000L §fKrypton§7 / 3: §c2500L §fXenon
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_13=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_14=§f§lBit 2: §9§lSuperconductive Deionization
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_15=If this bit is on, you must insert §c1440L §fMolten Superconductor Base.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_16=Using higher tier superconductor provides bonus output
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_17=Output multiplier: §2UV§7: §f1x§7 / §4UHV§7: §f1.25x§7 / §5UEV§7: §f1.5x§7 / §1§lUIV§7: §f1.75x§7 / §c§lUMV§7: §f2x
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_18=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_19=§f§lBit 3: §9§lGravitationally-Generated Differential Vacuum Extraction
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_20=If this bit is on, you must insert §c4608L §fMolten Neutronium
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_21=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_22=§f§lBit 4: §9§lSeldonian Settlement Process
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_23=If this bit is on,§c DISREGARD §7all other bits and do not insert anything
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_24=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_25=§f§lNo bits: §9§lMachine Overload
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_26=In rare cases, the machine may overload and output no control signal at all
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_27=To prevent machine damage, insert §c10000L §fSuper Coolant.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_28=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_29=The recipe can only succeed if the entire signal is decoded correctly
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_30=Inserting any fluid not requested by the signal will always void the recipe
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_31=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_32=§b§oThe penultimate stage of water purification, step seven, is an irregular series of complex
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_33=§b§oprocesses designed to remove any residual materials left by the decontaminants from the previous
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_34=§b§osteps such as any energetic ions, acids, clarifiers, or gasses. Depending on what the Degasser
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09412_Index_35=§b§odetects in the water, it will request various materials to complete the processes listed above.
