    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09413_Index_00=Can be installed in the Degasser Purification Unit.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09413_Index_01=Outputs Redstone Signal Strength based on the current control signal.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_00=Tipo de máquina: §eUnidad de Purificación§r
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_01=§b§lWater Tier: §f8§r
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_02=Must be linked to a Purification Plant using a data stick to work
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_03=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_04=Insert §fQuark Releasing Catalysts §7into the input bus while running
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_05=Every recipe cycle, a different combination of §c2§7 different §fQuark Releasing Catalysts
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_06=will correctly identify the lone quark and succeed the recipe
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_07=The order of catalysts in the combination does not matter, so §9Up§7/§dDown§7 can be identified by inserting §dDown§7/§9Up
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_08=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_09=Every §c20§7 ticks, consumes ALL catalysts in the input bus
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_10=The base cost of inserting a catalyst is §c144L§f Molten Infinity
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_11=For every duplicate occurrence of an inserted catalyst in the sequence, this cost is doubled
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_12=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_13=Keeps track of the entire sequence of catalysts inserted this recipe
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_14=If the correct catalyst combination is in the sequence of inserted catalysts, immediately outputs §c2000L §fStabilised Baryonic Matter
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_15=At the end of a successful recipe, outputs additional §c500L §fStabilised Baryonic Matter§7 per parallel
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_16=At the end of the recipe, returns all incorrectly inserted catalysts in the output bus
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_17=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_18=§b§oThe final stage of water purification goes beyond subatomic particles and identifies the smallest
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_19=§b§opossible imperfections within the baryons themselves. By correctly identifying which pairs of quark
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_20=§b§oflavors are required, the unit will activate the catalysts, stabilizing the errant particles
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_21=§b§oThis ultimately creates both Stabilised Baryonic Matter and, most importantly, absolutely perfectly purified water.
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09414_Index_22=§7§m-----------------------------------------
