    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10505_Index_05=Increasing Structure Length increases output §9Beam Energy§7 but decreases §cBeam Focus§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10505_Index_06=Requires §fLength * kL/s §7of §bcoolant§7 for operation
