    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10506_Index_08=Each §6Particle Type§7 has a §aMaximum Particle Energy§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10506_Index_09=§6Alpha§7 : §a8000keV§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10506_Index_10=§6Proton§7 : §a15000keV§7
