    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_03=Use screwdriver while sneaking to enable/disable IC2 mode
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_04=Use wire cutters to give incoming IC2 seeds 0 humidity
