    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_10=§6Setup Mode:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_11=Does not take power
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_12=There are two modes: input / output
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_13=Input mode: machine will take seeds from input bus and plant them
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_14=[IC2] You need to also input block that is required under the crop
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_15=Output mode: machine will take planted seeds and output them
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_16=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_17=§6Normal Crops:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_18=Minimal voltage tier: §8EV§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_19=Starting with 1 slot
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_20=Every tier past §8EV§7, slots are multiplied by 2
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_21=Every slot adds 64 seed to the total seed capacity
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_22=Base process time: 5 sec
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_23=Process time is divided by number of tiers past §eHV§7 (Minimum 1 sec)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_24=All crops are grown at the end of the operation
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_25=Does not drop seeds
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_26=Can consume up to 2 fertilizer per seed per cycle
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_27=Boost per fertilizer: 200%
