    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_31=Minimal glass tier: §dLuV§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_32=Starting with 4 slot
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_12792_Index_33=Every tier past §dLuV§7, slots are multiplied by 4
