    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_01=Spawns and kills monsters for you!
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_02=Produces §a120 Liquid XP§7 per operation
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_03=Powered Spawner goes in Controller Slot
