    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_05=Supports §dperfect OC!
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_06=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_07=Has a minimum recipe time of 20 ticks, further overclocks multiply outputs by 4x
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_08=Recipe time is based on mob health
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_09=You can additionally put a weapon inside the GUI
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_10=It will speed up the process and apply the looting level from the weapon (maximum 4 levels)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_11=Enable Weapon Preservation to prevent the weapon from breaking on it's last hit
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_12=Enable Weapon Cycling to pull a weapon from input when the current one breaks or is moved to an output
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_13=§cEnchanting the spikes inside the structure does nothing!
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_14=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_15=If the mob spawns §cinfernal§7, it will drain 8 times more power!
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_16=You can prevent §cinfernal§7 spawns by shift clicking with a screwdriver
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_17=Mobs who are always §cinfernal§7 will ignore this factor
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_18=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_19=You can enable ritual mode with a screwdriver
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_20=When in ritual mode, can link to above Well of Suffering rituals
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_21=The Ritual must be built directly centered above the machine
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_22=When linked, mobs will start to buffer and die very slowly, providing blood to the linked altar
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_23=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_24=You can disable mob animation with a soldering iron
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14201_Index_25=You can enable batch mode with wire cutters. Providing §9 16x Time, Output, Weapon Damage
