    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_03=Use screwdriver + shift to change operation mode (NORMAL/SWARMER)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_04=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_05=§6Input Mode:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_06=- Does not take power
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_07=- Put your queens in the input bus to put them in the internal buffer
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_08=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_09=§6Output Mode:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_10=- Does not take power
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_11=- Will give your bees back to output bus
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_12=§7§m-----------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_13=§6Operating Mode:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_14=- NORMAL:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_15=  - Processing time: 5 seconds
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_16=  - Uses 1 §dLuV§7 amp per queen
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_17=  - All bees are accelerated 64 times
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_18=  - 8 production upgrades are applied
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_19=  - Genetic Stabilizer upgrade applied
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_20=  - Simulates perfect environment for your bees
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_21=  - Additionally you can provide royal jelly to increase the outputs:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_22=    - 1 royal jelly grants 5% bonus per bee
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_23=    - They will be consumed on each start of operation
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_24=    - and be applied to that operation only
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_25=    - Max bonus: 200%
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_26=- SWARMER:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_27=  - You can only insert 1 queen
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_28=  - It will slowly produce ignoble princesses
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_29=  - Consumes 100 royal jelly per operation
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_30=  - Base processing time: 1 minute
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_31=  - Uses 1 amp §aIV§7
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_14202_Index_32=  - Can overclock
