    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_01=§oAlso known as Godforge or Gorge for short
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_02=§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_03=A massive structure harnessing the thermal, gravitational and
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_04=kinetic energy of a stabilised neutron star for material processing
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_05=This multiblock can house §cup to 16 modules §7which utilize the star to energize materials
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_06=to varying degrees, ranging from regular smelting to matter degeneration
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_07=EU requirements for all modules are handled via wireless energy directly
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_08=§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_09=This multiblock has an §6extensive upgrade tree §7which influences all of its functions,
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_10=such as §6unlocking new module types§7, §6increasing heat levels §7and §6granting
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_11=§6various processing speed bonuses§7. §7These upgrades can be unlocked by reaching
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_12=certain milestones and/or spending materials
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_13=§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_14=§aClicking on the logo in the controller gui opens an extensive information window§7,
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15411_Index_15=explaining everything there is to know about this multiblock
